@startuml dsh-state-ticket
' Planned UML secondary view: Ticket 状态（阶段表派生）
' Evidence: src/core/stage.ts:5-21; docs/003:9-21; docs/001:35
title Ticket 阶段状态图（首匹配行胜出）

[*] --> Queued : accept 创建 (pending assignment)
Queued --> Working : assignmentStarted
Working --> Idle : report waiting / turn 结束 (无后台)
Idle --> Working : 新 Input 送达 (wake)
Working --> Working : report progress
Working --> PersonReview : report ready
Working --> PersonBlocked : report blocked
Working --> PersonFailed : report failed
PersonBlocked --> Working : 人的消息到达
PersonFailed --> Working : 人的消息到达 / retry
PersonReview --> EndedCompleted : ready 且无 follow Threads
Working --> EndedDropped : report dropped
Idle --> EndedMerged : 跟随的 PR merged (followsDone)
Idle --> EndedClosed : 跟随的 PR closed (followsDone)
PersonBlocked --> PersonDelivery : Input 投递失败
PersonDelivery --> Working : 投递成功 / 新 Assignment / retry
PersonReview --> Idle : 人的 follow-up 继续（同 Mandate，无 Eval）
EndedCompleted --> [*]
EndedDropped --> [*]
EndedMerged --> [*]
EndedClosed --> [*]
note right of PersonReview
  person 阶段 = 不能继续、必须人介入
  Ended 后：人消息可 resume（Mandate 重验证），
  stop（人）则 Mandate 撤销、永不复用
end note
@enduml
